# .graphifyignore — Go (code graph carve-out)
#
# Copied into the repo checkout at build time from the VAULT-side copy at
# graphify/<repo>/.graphifyignore, which is the reviewable, committed one.
# PURE DENYLIST — never add a `!negation` line; negation is not available here.
#
# Scope for this stack is the repo root minus this file — which is exactly what
# the "workspace root minus the standard denylist" shape means everywhere else.

# --- dependencies -----------------------------------------------------------
vendor/
third_party/
node_modules/

